<h2>The ten styles</h2>
<p>Every style is the <a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/film/">film</a> with one change. Add a style the same way: one modifier class on <code>im-studio-thumb</code>, one thing different.</p>
<div class="im-table-scroll"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Style</th><th>The one thing</th><th>Class</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/film/">Film</a></td><td>The person right, the accent behind the shoulder, a kicker and a title, a word in the hand.</td><td><code>im-studio-thumb</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/vlog/">Vlog</a></td><td>The photograph fills the frame; REC and viewfinder corners; the day in the hand, big.</td><td><code>-vlog</code> + <code>im-studio-corners</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/travel/">Travel</a></td><td>The place is the picture; the person small and ringed; a route and the price in pixel type.</td><td><code>-travel</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/qna/">Q&amp;A</a></td><td>The question in the hand, a giant mark behind, the golden pattern on cream.</td><td><code>-qna</code> + <code>im-studio-cream</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/series/">Series</a></td><td>The episode numeral behind the person; a ring of the accent instead of the block.</td><td><code>-series</code> + <code>im-studio-person-ring</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/live/">Live</a></td><td>Dark; the live dot; the day and time.</td><td><code>im-studio-dark</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/commentary/">Commentary</a></td><td>The thing in a tilted window, the face beside it, a reaction with an arrow.</td><td><code>-commentary</code> + <code>im-studio-subject</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/skit/">Skit</a></td><td>The accent is the ground; the title hand-written and tilted; stickers.</td><td><code>-skit</code> + <code>im-studio-accent</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/tutorial/">Tutorial</a></td><td>Dark; one line of code where the kicker was.</td><td><code>im-studio-dark</code> + <code>im-studio-code</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnails/short/">Short</a></td><td>1080 × 1920; the person fills it; the words at the foot.</td><td><code>-short</code></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
